description=Connections API 1 and PC Network status/pairing app; persistent private/public links never grant inventory access. Notification API 1 adds guarded taskbar notices. MP testing candidate; use matching versions on all peers. Standalone Lua-only Windows '93 desktop and app registration framework. Provides powered stock-computer validation and reusable server-owned bindings to real media in physical storage. Applications validate their own permissions, data and media operations. Does not require Quartermaster. Development build: native SP and dedicated multiplayer NOT TESTED; G7 and stable G8 BLOCKED. MP testing build - dedicated multiplayer NOT TESTED.
